# Writing Project Contract

Use `human-writing-skills` only with the modules required by the request.

- Canonical setting, character, relationship, timeline, and terminology facts:
  `ledger.md`.
- Approved prose/style evidence, only when explicitly requested: `reference/`.
- Serious-document sources, only for news, academic, legal, or technical work:
  `sources/`.
- For work larger than one reliable context window, use `human-writing-mcp`:
  plan the audit, complete every receipt, verify coverage, then reconcile.

Do not claim a full-manuscript review unless every required task in the audit
package has a complete Coverage Receipt. Treat the ledger and supplied sources
as authoritative; a reference sample is not factual evidence.
